Terminals unused in grammar

    ENDFILE


Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: declare_list

    2 declare_list: declare_list declare
    3             | declare

    4 declare: var_declare
    5        | func_declare

    6 var_declare: type_spec id SEMI

    7 @1: ε

    8 var_declare: type_spec id @1 LBRACE num RBRACE SEMI

    9 id: ID

   10 num: NUM

   11 type_spec: INT
   12          | VOID

   13 @2: ε

   14 func_declare: type_spec id @2 LPAREN params RPAREN compound_stmt

   15 params: param_list
   16       | VOID

   17 param_list: param_list COMMA param
   18           | param

   19 param: type_spec id
   20      | type_spec id LBRACE RBRACE

   21 compound_stmt: LCURLY local_declare stmt_list RCURLY

   22 local_declare: local_declare var_declare
   23              | ε

   24 stmt_list: stmt_list stmt
   25          | ε

   26 stmt: exp_stmt
   27     | compound_stmt
   28     | if_stmt
   29     | if_else_stmt
   30     | iteration_stmt
   31     | val_ret_stmt
   32     | non_val_ret_stmt

   33 exp_stmt: exp SEMI
   34         | SEMI

   35 if_stmt: IF LPAREN exp RPAREN stmt

   36 if_else_stmt: IF LPAREN exp RPAREN stmt ELSE stmt

   37 iteration_stmt: WHILE LPAREN exp RPAREN stmt

   38 non_val_ret_stmt: RETURN SEMI

   39 val_ret_stmt: RETURN exp SEMI

   40 exp: var ASSIGN exp
   41    | simple_exp

   42 simple_exp: additive_exp relop additive_exp
   43           | additive_exp

   44 var: id

   45 @3: ε

   46 var: id @3 LBRACE exp RBRACE

   47 relop: GE
   48      | GT
   49      | LT
   50      | LE
   51      | EQ
   52      | NE

   53 additive_exp: additive_exp addop term
   54             | term

   55 addop: PLUS
   56      | MINUS

   57 term: term mulop factor
   58     | factor

   59 mulop: TIMES
   60      | OVER

   61 @4: ε

   62 call: id @4 LPAREN args RPAREN

   63 args: arg_list
   64     | ε

   65 arg_list: arg_list COMMA exp
   66         | exp

   67 factor: LPAREN exp RPAREN
   68       | var
   69       | call
   70       | num
   71       | ERROR


